{"html":"<hr/>\n<h2 id=\"title-pod-生命周期description-kubernetes-pod-生命周期与状态管理\">title: Pod 生命周期\ndescription: Kubernetes Pod 生命周期与状态管理</h2>\n<div class=\"relative mb-10 pb-8 border-b border-[var(--border-subtle)]\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 -top-20 -mx-8 h-64 bg-gradient-to-b from-indigo-500/[0.04] to-transparent pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"relative space-y-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md text-[0.68rem] font-semibold font-mono\" style=\"color:var(--text-accent);background:var(--accent-bg)\">⚫⚫⚪<!-- --> <!-- -->中级</span><span class=\"inline-flex px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md text-[0.68rem] font-medium border\" style=\"color:var(--text-tertiary);background:var(--surface-bg);border-color:var(--border-subtle)\">Kubernetes</span><span class=\"inline-flex px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md text-[0.68rem] font-medium border\" style=\"color:var(--text-tertiary);background:var(--surface-bg);border-color:var(--border-subtle)\">Pod</span><span class=\"inline-flex px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md text-[0.68rem] font-medium border\" style=\"color:var(--text-tertiary);background:var(--surface-bg);border-color:var(--border-subtle)\">Lifecycle</span></div><h1 class=\"font-display font-extrabold text-3xl tracking-[-0.03em]\" style=\"color:var(--text-primary)\">Pod 生命周期</h1><p class=\"text-[0.9rem] leading-relaxed max-w-2xl\" style=\"color:var(--text-tertiary)\">深入理解 Kubernetes Pod 从创建到终止的完整生命周期，掌握状态管理、探针配置和故障排查的核心知识。</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 text-[0.75rem]\" style=\"color:var(--text-muted)\"><span>⏱ <!-- -->8 min<!-- --> read</span><span>📊 <!-- -->Intermediate</span></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"glow-card p-5 my-8\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-md bg-indigo-500/15 flex items-center justify-center\"><span class=\"text-xs\" style=\"color:var(--text-accent)\">⚡</span></div><span class=\"text-[0.75rem] font-semibold tracking-wide\" style=\"color:var(--text-accent)\">TL;DR</span></div><div class=\"text-[0.88rem] leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\"><p><strong>Pod 生命周期</strong> 是 Kubernetes 中最核心的概念之一。</p><ul>\n<li><strong>Pod Phase</strong> — Pending → Running → Succeeded/Failed</li>\n<li><strong>Init Container</strong> — 在主容器启动前按顺序执行</li>\n<li><strong>Probes</strong> — Liveness（重启）、Readiness（流量）、Startup（慢启动保护）</li>\n<li><strong>Hooks</strong> — PostStart（启动后）、PreStop（优雅终止）</li>\n<li><strong>RestartPolicy</strong> — Always / OnFailure / Never</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<h2 id=\"pod-生命周期流程图\">Pod 生命周期流程图</h2>\n<div class=\"my-8 glass-card p-5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><span class=\"text-xs\" style=\"color:var(--text-tertiary)\">📦</span><span class=\"text-[0.75rem] font-semibold tracking-wide\" style=\"color:var(--text-tertiary)\">Architecture</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto text-[0.78rem] leading-relaxed font-mono whitespace-pre\" style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\"><pre><code>                    ┌─────────────────────┐\n                    │     Pending         │\n                    │  (调度+拉取镜像)    │\n                    └──────────┬──────────┘\n                               ▼\n                    ┌─────────────────────┐\n                    │     Running          │\n                    │  Init容器→主容器运行 │\n                    └──────────┬──────────┘\n                               ▼\n                    ┌─────────────────────┐\n                    │    Succeeded         │\n                    │  (正常完成退出码=0)  │\n                    └─────────────────────┘\n                               │\n                    ┌──────────▼──────────┐\n                    │     Failed          │\n                    │  (异常退出退出码≠0) │\n                    └─────────────────────┘\n                               │\n                    ┌──────────▼──────────┐\n                    │    CrashLoopBackOff │\n                    │  (容器重启循环)     │\n                    └─────────────────────┘\n</code></pre></pre><p class=\"mt-3 text-[0.72rem] text-center\" style=\"color:var(--text-muted)\">Kubernetes Pod 生命周期状态转换</p></div>\n<h2 id=\"pod-相位-phase\">Pod 相位 (Phase)</h2>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Phase</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Pending</td><td>Pod 已被 Kubernetes 系统接受，等待调度</td></tr><tr><td>Running</td><td>Pod 已绑定到节点，容器已创建</td></tr><tr><td>Succeeded</td><td>所有容器正常退出，不会重启</td></tr><tr><td>Failed</td><td>所有容器已终止，至少一个容器失败</td></tr><tr><td>Unknown</td><td>无法获取 Pod 状态</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"init-container\">Init Container</h2>\n<div class=\"my-6 rounded-xl border border-[var(--border-subtle)] border-l-4 p-4\" style=\"border-left-color:var(--emerald-400);background:var(--surface-bg)\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2 text-[0.75rem] font-semibold tracking-wide\" style=\"color:var(--emerald-400)\">💡<!-- --> <!-- -->关键概念</div><div class=\"text-[0.85rem] leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\"><p>Init Container 在主容器启动之前按顺序执行。所有 Init Container 必须成功完成，主容器才会启动。常用于：等待依赖服务就绪、数据库初始化、文件权限设置。</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"terminal-block my-6\"><div class=\"terminal-header\"><span class=\"terminal-dot\" style=\"background:#ff5f56\"></span><span class=\"terminal-dot\" style=\"background:#ffbd2e\"></span><span class=\"terminal-dot\" style=\"background:#27c93f\"></span><span class=\"ml-2\">init-container.yaml</span><div class=\"flex-1\"></div><span class=\"text-[0.65rem]\" style=\"color:var(--text-muted)\">Copy</span></div><pre class=\"p-4 overflow-x-auto\"><code class=\"text-[0.8rem] font-mono leading-relaxed whitespace-pre\" style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">apiVersion: v1\nkind: Pod\nmetadata:\nname: myapp\nspec:\ninitContainers:\n- name: init-db\n  image: busybox:1.36\n  command: [&#x27;sh&#x27;, &#x27;-c&#x27;, &#x27;until nslookup db-service; do echo waiting for db; sleep 2; done&#x27;]\n- name: init-cache\n  image: busybox:1.36\n  command: [&#x27;sh&#x27;, &#x27;-c&#x27;, &#x27;sleep 5&#x27;]\ncontainers:\n- name: myapp\n  image: myapp:v1\n  ports:\n  - containerPort: 8080</code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"probes-探针\">Probes 探针</h2>\n<h3 id=\"liveness-probe-vs-readiness-probe\">Liveness Probe vs Readiness Probe</h3>\n<div class=\"my-6 rounded-xl border border-[var(--border-subtle)] border-l-4 p-4\" style=\"border-left-color:var(--accent-light);background:var(--surface-bg)\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2 text-[0.75rem] font-semibold tracking-wide\" style=\"color:var(--accent-light)\">💬<!-- --> <!-- -->Interview</div><div class=\"text-[0.85rem] leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\"><p><strong>高频面试题</strong>: Liveness Probe 和 Readiness Probe 的区别是什么？</p><ul>\n<li><strong>Liveness</strong>: 容器是否存活。失败 → 重启容器。用于检测死锁、无限循环等无法自行恢复的状态。</li>\n<li><strong>Readiness</strong>: 容器是否就绪接收流量。失败 → 从 Service Endpoints 移除。用于检测依赖服务（数据库、缓存）是否可用。</li>\n<li><strong>Startup</strong>: 慢启动容器保护。在 Startup Probe 成功之前，Liveness 和 Readiness 不生效。</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div class=\"terminal-block my-6\"><div class=\"terminal-header\"><span class=\"terminal-dot\" style=\"background:#ff5f56\"></span><span class=\"terminal-dot\" style=\"background:#ffbd2e\"></span><span class=\"terminal-dot\" style=\"background:#27c93f\"></span><span class=\"ml-2\">probes.yaml</span><div class=\"flex-1\"></div><span class=\"text-[0.65rem]\" style=\"color:var(--text-muted)\">Copy</span></div><pre class=\"p-4 overflow-x-auto\"><code class=\"text-[0.8rem] font-mono leading-relaxed whitespace-pre\" style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">apiVersion: v1\nkind: Pod\nmetadata:\nname: probes-demo\nspec:\ncontainers:\n- name: app\n  image: myapp:v1\n  livenessProbe:\n    httpGet:\n      path: /healthz\n      port: 8080\n    initialDelaySeconds: 15\n    periodSeconds: 10\n  readinessProbe:\n    httpGet:\n      path: /ready\n      port: 8080\n    initialDelaySeconds: 5\n    periodSeconds: 5\n  startupProbe:\n    httpGet:\n      path: /startup\n      port: 8080\n    failureThreshold: 30\n    periodSeconds: 10</code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"interview-focus\">Interview Focus</h2>\n<div class=\"my-8 space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4\"><span class=\"text-xs\" style=\"color:var(--text-accent)\">🎯</span><h2 class=\"text-[0.85rem] font-bold tracking-wide\" style=\"color:var(--text-primary)\">Interview Focus</h2></div><div class=\"glass-card p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"text-[0.85rem] font-semibold\" style=\"color:var(--text-primary)\">Q: <!-- -->Pod 的生命周期有哪些状态？状态之间如何转换？</h3><span class=\"shrink-0 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[0.62rem] font-semibold font-mono\" style=\"background:rgba(251,191,36,0.1);color:var(--amber-400)\">中级</span></div><div class=\"space-y-2 text-[0.78rem]\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-xs\" style=\"color:var(--amber-400)\">💡</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-secondary);font-weight:500\">面试官意图: </span><span style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">考察对 Pod 状态机的理解深度，尤其是 Pending 阶段发生了什么（调度 + 镜像拉取 + 卷挂载）</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-xs\" style=\"color:var(--text-accent)\">💬</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-secondary);font-weight:500\">回答建议: </span><span style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">不仅要说出状态名称，更要解释状态转换的条件和每个阶段的底层操作</span></div></div></div><div class=\"glass-card p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"text-[0.85rem] font-semibold\" style=\"color:var(--text-primary)\">Q: <!-- -->Liveness Probe 和 Readiness Probe 的区别？什么场景下需要 Startup Probe？</h3><span class=\"shrink-0 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[0.62rem] font-semibold font-mono\" style=\"background:rgba(251,191,36,0.1);color:var(--amber-400)\">中级</span></div><div class=\"space-y-2 text-[0.78rem]\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-xs\" style=\"color:var(--amber-400)\">💡</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-secondary);font-weight:500\">面试官意图: </span><span style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">考察探针的实战经验，尤其是 Readiness Probe 对 Service 流量分发的影响</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-xs\" style=\"color:var(--text-accent)\">💬</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-secondary);font-weight:500\">回答建议: </span><span style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">结合真实场景说明：比如 Java 应用慢启动需要 Startup Probe 保护，数据库迁移时要让 Readiness 返回 false</span></div></div></div><div class=\"glass-card p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"text-[0.85rem] font-semibold\" style=\"color:var(--text-primary)\">Q: <!-- -->Pod 一直处于 Pending 状态，如何排查？</h3><span class=\"shrink-0 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[0.62rem] font-semibold font-mono\" style=\"background:rgba(248,113,113,0.1);color:var(--red-400)\">高级</span></div><div class=\"space-y-2 text-[0.78rem]\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-xs\" style=\"color:var(--amber-400)\">💡</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-secondary);font-weight:500\">面试官意图: </span><span style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">考察故障排查的系统方法论和 kubectl 命令熟练度</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-xs\" style=\"color:var(--text-accent)\">💬</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-secondary);font-weight:500\">回答建议: </span><span style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">按顺序排查：kubectl describe pod → Events → 节点资源 → 调度器日志 → PVC/ConfigMap</span></div></div></div></div>\n<h2 id=\"常见故障排查\">常见故障排查</h2>\n<div class=\"my-8\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4\"><span class=\"text-xs\" style=\"color:var(--amber-400)\">⚠</span><h2 class=\"text-[0.85rem] font-bold tracking-wide\" style=\"color:var(--text-primary)\">Common Issues</h2></div><div class=\"grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"glass-card p-4\"><code class=\"text-[0.78rem] font-semibold font-mono\" style=\"color:var(--red-400)\">Pod Pending</code><p class=\"text-[0.75rem] mt-1.5 leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:var(--text-tertiary)\">调度失败或镜像拉取中。检查节点资源 (CPU/Memory)、PVC 绑定、NodeSelector 匹配。</p></div><div class=\"glass-card p-4\"><code class=\"text-[0.78rem] font-semibold font-mono\" style=\"color:var(--red-400)\">CrashLoopBackOff</code><p class=\"text-[0.75rem] mt-1.5 leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:var(--text-tertiary)\">容器反复崩溃重启。查看 kubectl logs --previous 获取上次崩溃日志。</p></div><div class=\"glass-card p-4\"><code class=\"text-[0.78rem] font-semibold font-mono\" style=\"color:var(--red-400)\">ImagePullBackOff</code><p class=\"text-[0.75rem] mt-1.5 leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:var(--text-tertiary)\">镜像拉取失败。检查镜像名称/tag 是否正确，ImagePullSecret 是否配置。</p></div><div class=\"glass-card p-4\"><code class=\"text-[0.78rem] font-semibold font-mono\" style=\"color:var(--red-400)\">Node NotReady</code><p class=\"text-[0.75rem] mt-1.5 leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:var(--text-tertiary)\">节点不可用。检查 kubelet 状态、磁盘压力、网络连通性。</p></div></div></div>\n<h2 id=\"production-advice\">Production Advice</h2>\n<div class=\"my-8\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4\"><span class=\"text-xs\" style=\"color:var(--text-tertiary)\">👁</span><h2 class=\"text-[0.85rem] font-bold tracking-wide\" style=\"color:var(--text-primary)\">Production Advice</h2></div><div class=\"grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"glass-card p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-xs\" style=\"background:var(--surface-bg);color:var(--emerald-400)\">✅</div><div><h3 class=\"text-[0.8rem] font-semibold\" style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">始终配置 Liveness + Readiness</h3><p class=\"text-[0.73rem] mt-1 leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:var(--text-tertiary)\">不要依赖默认行为。Liveness 防止死锁，Readiness 控制流量切换，缺一不可。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"glass-card p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-xs\" style=\"background:var(--surface-bg);color:var(--amber-400)\">🛡</div><div><h3 class=\"text-[0.8rem] font-semibold\" style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">使用 securityContext 限制权限</h3><p class=\"text-[0.73rem] mt-1 leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:var(--text-tertiary)\">设置 runAsNonRoot: true，限制 capabilities，配置 readOnlyRootFilesystem。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"glass-card p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-xs\" style=\"background:var(--surface-bg);color:var(--blue-400)\">📈</div><div><h3 class=\"text-[0.8rem] font-semibold\" style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">合理设置 resources.requests</h3><p class=\"text-[0.73rem] mt-1 leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:var(--text-tertiary)\">requests 决定调度决策，limits 防止资源争抢。requests 设太低会导致节点过载。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"glass-card p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-xs\" style=\"background:var(--surface-bg);color:var(--purple-400)\">📊</div><div><h3 class=\"text-[0.8rem] font-semibold\" style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">监控 Pod 重启次数</h3><p class=\"text-[0.73rem] mt-1 leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:var(--text-tertiary)\">设置告警：Pod restarts &gt; 5 in 10m。频繁重启往往是应用 bug 或资源不足的信号。</p></div></div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"my-6 rounded-xl border border-[var(--border-subtle)] border-l-4 p-4\" style=\"border-left-color:var(--purple-400);background:var(--surface-bg)\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2 text-[0.75rem] font-semibold tracking-wide\" style=\"color:var(--purple-400)\">👁<!-- --> <!-- -->Production</div><div class=\"text-[0.85rem] leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\"><p><strong>生产环境检查清单</strong>:</p><ul>\n<li>所有 Pod 配置了 Liveness + Readiness Probe</li>\n<li>Init Container 有合理的超时和重试机制</li>\n<li>PreStop Hook 确保优雅终止（处理进行中的请求）</li>\n<li>PodDisruptionBudget 保证高可用</li>\n<li>设置了合理的 terminationGracePeriodSeconds</li>\n</ul></div></div>"}